<body class="category-page">
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
{% include "partials/topbar.njk" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <div class="cat-hero">
    <div class="start-hero-wrap">
      <h1 class="cat-title">Reach people the moment they're looking for you.</h1>
      <p class="cat-desc">Someone searching <em>"pottery classes vancouver"</em> is exactly who a pottery studio wants — and they land here. A sponsorship puts your business at the top of that page, clearly labeled, in the directory's own warm voice. It's advertising that doesn't feel like advertising.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-content prose-content">

    <div class="advertise-stats">
      <div class="advertise-stat"><strong>~3,800</strong><span>visits a month, and climbing</span></div>
      <div class="advertise-stat"><strong>40+</strong><span>niche categories</span></div>
      <div class="advertise-stat"><strong>~100%</strong><span>from people actively searching</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2>This is what you get</h2>
    <p>Two ways to show up. A <strong>sponsor card</strong> sits at the top of your category page, in the same style as everything else on the site. Here's exactly how it looks:</p>

    <div class="advertise-mockup">
      {%- set sponsorData = { name: "Clayground Studio", where: "Mount Pleasant", description: "Drop-in wheel nights and 6-week beginner courses. First class is on us.", cta: "See class times" } %}
      {%- set sponsorSlot = "advertise-example" %}{% set sponsorDemo = true %}
      {% include "partials/sponsor-card.njk" %}
      <p class="advertise-mockup-cap">An example — your name, a short description you approve, and one link. Always marked "Community sponsor" and "Ad."</p>
    </div>

    <p>A <strong>banner</strong> is your own image. Put one between the listings on a category page, or in the sidebar on every page.</p>
    <div class="advertise-mockup advertise-banners" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="advertise-banner-demo advertise-banner-wide">Category banner<br><span>1200&times;300 image</span></div>
      <div class="advertise-banner-demo advertise-banner-box">Sidebar banner<br><span>600&times;500 image</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="advertise-mockup-cap">Banners are always marked "Ad". Send a PNG or JPG, or ask and I'll make a simple one in the site's style.</p>

    <h2>Where it shows</h2>
    <div class="advertise-tiers">
      <div class="advertise-tier">
        <h3>Category sponsor</h3>
        <p class="advertise-tier-price">$39/month <span>or $350/year</span></p>
        <ul>
