          <li>Reaches the exact people searching for your niche in Vancouver this week</li>
          <li>One sponsor per category, ever. No bidding wars, no rotation</li>
          <li>A welcome mention in the weekly newsletter when you start</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="advertise-cta" href="https://tally.so/r/dbaRVr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="category">Claim a category &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="advertise-tier">
        <h3>Category banner</h3>
        <p class="advertise-tier-price">$25/month <span>or $250/year</span></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your image between the listings on one category page</li>
          <li>Seen by everyone who scrolls the list</li>
          <li>One banner per category</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="advertise-cta" href="https://tally.so/r/dbaRVr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-umami-event="click-advertise-form" data-umami-event-tier="category-banner">Book a banner &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="advertise-tier">
        <h3>Sidebar banner</h3>
        <p class="advertise-tier-price">$79/month</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your image in the sidebar of every category page, guide, the homepage and Start here</li>
